1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,900
Aren't you excited we're going on our honeymoon?
你期待我們要去度蜜月嗎？

2
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,330
Yeah, I am.
我很期待

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,240
That's right, get it out of your system while we're alone.
沒錯，要發作就趁現在沒人的時候

4
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:17,040
-Hey. We came to say goodbye. -Yeah. Have a great honeymoon.
-我們是來道別的 -對，祝你們蜜月玩得愉快

5
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,040
-Thanks. -I better go pack.
-謝謝 -我最好去打包行李

6
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:22,910
No, I already packed. The only thing I couldn't find, though, was your Speedo.
不，我已經打包了 我只是找不到你的迷你泳褲

7
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:29,750
Speedo? I don't have a Speedo.
我沒有迷你泳褲

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:34,290
I'm gonna go pack my regular, long bathing suit.
我要去打包 我那不起眼的超長泳褲

9
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,990
Good, you're still here! I wanted to tell you to have a good honeymoon.
很好，你還在 我來祝你有個愉快的蜜月

10
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,690
Thank you!
謝謝

11
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:46,070
And I also wanted you guys to know that I am telling the father today.
我還要你們知道 今天我會告訴孩子的爸

12
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,170
What? What?
怎麼了？

13
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,320
-We know it's Ross. -How? How do you know?
-我們知道孩子的爸是羅斯 -你怎麼知道的？

14
00:00:57,490 --> 00:01:00,480
It was his sweater. But, oh, my God!
是他的毛衣，但是天啊

15
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:04,960
I so wanted Ross to know first. But I am so relieved that you guys know!
我好希望羅斯是第一個知道的 但你們知道了，我真的鬆了一口氣

16
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:07,650
That is so great. And I'm gonna be your baby's aunt!
這真的是太棒了 我是你孩子的姑姑

17
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:09,020
I know.
我知道

18
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,760
Me too!
我是阿姨

19
00:01:11,170 --> 00:01:14,140
And I'm gonna be an uncle! Come here.
我是叔叔，來吧

20
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:19,110
-You're all gonna be aunts and uncles. -Yeah, but I'm the only one related by blood.
-你們都會是孩子的姑姑、阿姨跟叔叔 -對，但只有我跟孩子有血緣關係

21
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:26,210
So now that you all know, you can help me. Give me some advice on how to tell Ross.
現在你們知道了，你們可以幫我 建議我該怎麼跟羅斯說

22
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:27,710
What were you gonna say?
你打算怎麼說？

23
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:32,250
I was gonna tell him that I'm gonna have it, and he can be as involved as he wants.
我要告訴他我想留下孩子 他想怎麼做都可以

24
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:34,150
Well, that sounds good.
聽起來很不錯

25
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:38,780
Yeah, but, you know, how do I start? I mean, what's the first thing that I say?
對，只是，我該怎麼開口呢？ 我是說我的開場白應該是什麼？

26
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,830
-Okay, great. Thanks. -Hey, good luck.
-好吧，太棒了，謝謝 -祝你好運

27
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,730
Yeah, bye.
對，再見

28
00:01:48,770 --> 00:01:50,500
Hey, what was that all about?
那是怎麼一回事？

29
00:01:50,670 --> 00:01:54,970
Guess there's no harm in telling you now. Rachel and Ross are going to have a baby.
看來現在告訴你也沒關係 瑞秋懷了羅斯的孩子

30
00:01:55,140 --> 00:02:00,840
What?! I didn't even know that..! Why didn't you tell me?
什麼？我完全不知道 你為什麼不告訴我？

31
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,680
Why am I talking like this?
我為什麼會這樣說話？

32
00:02:05,250 --> 00:02:08,650
-I didn't think you could keep it a secret. -What?!
-我覺得你無法保密 -什麼？

33
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,360
What?!
什麼？

34
00:02:13,130 --> 00:02:16,390
I am an excellent secret-keeper. I have kept all our secrets.
我是保密高手 我一直保守著我們所有的秘密

35
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:19,300
-What secrets? -No, no, Joey.
-什麼秘密？ -不，喬伊

36
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:23,490
I'm not gonna tell you, because I am an excellent secret-keeper.
我不會告訴你 因為我是保密高手

37
00:02:27,010 --> 00:02:29,700
-You'll tell me later? -You already know.
-待會你會告訴我？ -你已經知道了

38
00:02:31,284 --> 00:02:33,479
The One Where Rachel Tells
本集播出：告知羅斯

00:02:34,284 --> 00:02:35,479
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

39
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:14,810
It's so romantic to send people off on their honeymoon.
送別人去度蜜月 真的好浪漫

40
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:19,360
You know, Monica and Chandler are married. Ross and Rachel are having a baby.
摩妮卡跟錢德結婚了 羅斯跟瑞秋就要生寶寶

41
00:03:19,530 --> 00:03:24,930
-Maybe you and I should do something. -All in good time, my love. All in good time.
-或許你跟我也該找些事來做 -你說的對，吾愛

42
00:03:27,170 --> 00:03:31,500
Shoot! I left my guitar in their apartment. Well, you can let me in later, right?
該死，我把吉他放在他們家 你待會能幫我開門吧？

43
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:34,160
No, I don't have a key. They took mine to give to you.
不，我沒有鑰匙 他們拿走我的鑰匙說是要交給你

44
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:39,410
-What? They took mine to give to you. -Why would they take away our keys?
-什麼？他們拿走我的說是要交給你 -他們為什麼要拿走我們的鑰匙？

45
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:41,070
Maybe they don't trust us.
或許他們不信任我們

46
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:44,180
They let me keep my key the last time they were out of town.
他們上次出城時 讓我保管他們的鑰匙

47
00:03:44,350 --> 00:03:49,220
The time you broke the ketchup bottle and cleaned it with Monica's guest towels?
那次你打破蕃茄醬瓶 拿摩妮卡給客人的毛巾來清理？

48
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:52,290
-Hey, I washed those. -No, you didn't.
-嘿，我洗了毛巾 -才沒有

49
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,790
Yeah, that didn't sound like me.
對，那聽起來不像我的作風

50
00:03:55,700 --> 00:04:00,000
-What will I do? I really need my guitar. -I have stuff in there too.
-我該怎麼辦？我需要我的吉他 -我也有東西放在他家

51
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:04,700
-What stuff? -Monica's chicken parm. I'll take care of it.
-什麼東西？ -摩妮卡的奶酪雞，我得把它解決掉

52
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:08,670
Hey, Mr. Treeger? It's Joey Tribbiani.
崔格先生？我是喬伊崔比亞尼

53
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:13,180
Listen, I need to get into Monica and Chandler's apartment. It's an emergency!
聽著，我得到摩妮卡跟錢德家 有緊急事件

54
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,980
Gas leak. Oh, and bring garlic bread.
瓦斯漏氣，帶大蒜麵包過來

55
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,680
-Hey, did Monica and Chandler take off yet? -Yeah.
-摩妮卡跟錢德出發了嗎？ -對

56
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:28,990
Damn. They left without my pass to the Nassau Fossil and Natural History Museum.
該死，他們沒有帶 納索化石與天然歷史博物館的通行證

57
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,960
There goes the honeymoon.
他們的蜜月泡湯了

58
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:34,700
-Did Rachel find you? -No, why?
-瑞秋找到你了嗎？ -不，怎麼了？

59
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:37,530
She was looking for you.
她在找你

60
00:04:37,710 --> 00:04:40,640
Well, I guess I'll catch up with her later.
那麼我待會再見她

61
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:46,140
-She really wanted to talk to you now. -Yeah, it seemed pretty important.
-她真的得馬上跟你談 -對，似乎是有重要的事

62
00:04:48,550 --> 00:04:50,140
Oh, no.
不

63
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,750
What?
什麼？

64
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:55,290
I think I might know what this is about.
我想我知道她有什麼事

65
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:58,690
Really?
真的嗎？

66
00:04:58,890 --> 00:05:04,390
Yeah. We promised we weren't gonna tell anybody this, but..
對，我們答應不會告訴任何人 但是…

67
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:09,360
About a month ago, Rachel and I slept together.
大約一個月前 瑞秋跟我上床

68
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,370
And?
結果呢？

69
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:18,410
Wow, I thought you'd be a little more shocked.
我以為 你們會大吃一驚

70
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:21,470
Oh, sorry. And?!
抱歉…結果呢？

71
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:29,720
Well, we said we'd just do it that one time..
我們說 只做一次…

72
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:33,790
but now I think she may wanna start things up again.
我想她或許 想要跟我復合

73
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:36,660
Yeah, I don't think that's what it is.
我想不是那樣的

74
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:42,630
-Why? What else could it be? -Oh, wow, I don't feel well.
-為什麼？不然會是什麼事？ -我覺得不太舒服

75
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:47,570
I'm telling you, that's what it is.
我相信就是那麼一回事

76
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:51,840
No wonder she was looking at me all funny during the wedding.
難怪在婚禮上 她看我的眼神怪怪的

77
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:55,010
She didn't say anything to you?
她什麼都沒有告訴你們？

78
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:57,880
-Maybe it's something you ate. -Could be, yeah.
-或許你吃錯東西了 -有可能

79
00:05:58,450 --> 00:06:02,650
-Please, just go and talk to Rachel. -Yeah, I guess I should.
-拜託，去跟瑞秋談一談 -好吧

80
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:07,550
Man, you know what I have to realize?
你們知道我領悟到什麼事嗎？

81
00:06:07,730 --> 00:06:12,500
Maybe I'm not the type of guy women can have just one night with.
或許我是那種 讓女人一夜難忘的男人

82
00:06:13,470 --> 00:06:18,270
You know, they always seem to want a little bit more.
她們對我 永遠都覺得不滿足

83
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:21,930
I should remember that.
我應該記得那一點的

84
00:06:31,590 --> 00:06:33,210
Next.
下一位

85
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:37,720
-They're kissing. Let's just go around them. -Leave them alone. They're in love.
-他們在接吻，我們先過去吧 -別管他們，他們深愛彼此

86
00:06:37,890 --> 00:06:41,330
I'm in love too. But in an orderly fashion.
我也愛你，不過愛得井然有序

87
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,860
Next.
下一位

88
00:06:43,030 --> 00:06:46,830
Hi. Can you do that and walk? Because she said, "Next."
嗨，你們能邊走邊接吻嗎？ 因為她說「下一位」

89
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:51,930
Sorry, we didn't hear you. We're on our honeymoon.
抱歉，我們沒有聽到 我們要去度蜜月

90
00:06:52,110 --> 00:06:58,170
Let me see what I can do. There are some first-class seats available.
讓我來看一下 頭等艙還有位置

91
00:06:58,350 --> 00:07:01,980
They bumped them up to first class because they're on their honeymoon!
她讓他們升級到頭等艙 因為他們要去度蜜月

92
00:07:02,150 --> 00:07:06,640
-Let's act like we're on our honeymoon. -We are on our honeymoon.
-我們假裝也要去度蜜月 -我們的確是要去度蜜月

93
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,580
Grab my ass.
快摸我屁股

94
00:07:09,990 --> 00:07:13,020
-Next. -Hi. Sorry, I almost didn't hear you.
-下一位 -抱歉，我差點沒聽見

95
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:17,560
You know, I'm just so in love with my new husband. We're on our honeymoon.
我深愛我的新婚丈夫 我們要去度蜜月

96
00:07:17,730 --> 00:07:19,600
-Congratulations. -Thanks.
-恭喜 -謝謝

97
00:07:19,770 --> 00:07:24,970
Okay, Mr. Bing, you'll be in 25J, and Mrs. Bing, you're in 25K.
好了，賓先生，你在25J 賓太太是25K

98
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:29,840
We're on our honeymoon, so can you do your little thing and bump us to first class?
我們要去度蜜月 你能讓我們升級到頭等艙嗎？

99
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:33,780
I'm sorry, all the first-class seats are taken. That couple got the last two.
抱歉，頭等艙客滿了 剛剛那對夫妻拿走最後兩個位置

100
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:39,680
See? If we'd gone around them like I said, she'd have given us those tickets! Damn it!
看吧？如果你聽我的話插他們的隊 她會給我們頭等艙的位置，該死

101
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:43,650
25J and K, any chance those aren't together?
25J跟K 會不會剛好不連在一起？

102
00:07:51,970 --> 00:07:55,930
I still can't believe they took away my key. I mean, you trust me with yours.
我還是不敢相信他們拿走我的鑰匙 你都把你的鑰匙交給我保管

103
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:58,660
Of course I do! And I'm gonna get it back to you..
那當然 我會把它還給你…

104
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:02,540
just as soon as they're done with it at the key-shining place.
只要清理鑰匙的人 把它擦乾淨了

105
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,440
-What the hell is that? -I don't know.
-那是什麼聲音？ -我不知道

106
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,920
Treeger, what are you doing?
崔格，你在做什麼？

107
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:14,820
-You said there was a gas leak. -Why not use your key?
-你說有瓦斯漏氣 -你為什麼不用鑰匙開門？

108
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:18,450
By the time I found it on this thing, the whole place might have exploded.
等我找到他們家的鑰匙 這間公寓可能都炸掉了

109
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:22,290
If that happens at another building I manage, people will ask questions.
如果我管理的公寓再發生一次爆炸意外 人們會開始問問題

110
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:24,120
Come on, hurry up!
快一點

111
00:08:27,130 --> 00:08:29,470
Well, we could have done that.
要那麼做我們也會

112
00:08:32,370 --> 00:08:35,740
Look at that! They're going into the first-class lounge.
你看 他們走進頭等艙休息室了

113
00:08:35,910 --> 00:08:37,940
-Do you know what they have in there? -No.
-你知道裡面有什麼嗎？ -不知道

114
00:08:38,110 --> 00:08:40,440
Me neither. We have to get in!
我也不知道，我們得進去才行

115
00:08:42,350 --> 00:08:46,080
-Just act like you belong. -Oh, my God! Oranges!
-裝做你是頭等艙的客人 -天啊，有橘子

116
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:52,550
-Nice to see you again. -Sir, may I see your tickets, please?
-很高興又跟你見面了 -先生，麻煩出示你的機票

117
00:08:53,330 --> 00:08:55,060
Yes, of course.
沒問題

118
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,760
Would you move your thumb? I can't see the seat number.
麻煩將你的姆指挪開 我看不到座位號碼

119
00:08:58,930 --> 00:09:01,990
That's all right. I have it memorized. It's 1A.
沒關係 我已經背起來了，是1A

120
00:09:04,670 --> 00:09:08,630
-Sir, this isn't a first-class ticket. I'm sorry. -Apology accepted. Excuse us.
-這不是頭等艙的機票，抱歉 -沒關係，對不起

121
00:09:08,810 --> 00:09:13,140
Sir, I'm afraid I'm gonna have to ask you to leave.
先生 恐怕我得請你們離開

122
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,580
Fine.
好吧

123
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,250
Go, go!
快跑

124
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:33,360
-Hi. -Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

125
00:09:33,730 --> 00:09:35,000
Hi.
嗨

126
00:09:36,470 --> 00:09:39,700
I think there's something that we really need to talk about.
我想我們真的需要 好好地談一談

127
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:43,940
I think we do. Why don't we go inside.
沒錯，我們先進去吧

128
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:54,380
-Look, I know why you're here. -You do?
-聽著，我知道你為什麼會來這裡 -真的？

129
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,750
Yeah, and to save you from any embarrassment..
對 為了讓你有點面子…

130
00:09:57,930 --> 00:10:00,860
I think maybe I should talk first.
我想或許應該我先說

131
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:02,460
-Okay. -Okay?
-好吧 -好嗎？

132
00:10:12,010 --> 00:10:14,410
Ross and Rachel.
羅斯跟瑞秋

133
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,600
Rachel and Ross.
瑞秋跟羅斯

134
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:22,340
That's been one heck of a seesaw, hasn't it?
那像是在玩蹺蹺板 對吧？

135
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:24,880
What?
什麼？

136
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:31,820
I mean, look, that one night we had was fun and certainly passionate.
我是說那晚 我們過得既滿足又盡性

137
00:10:31,990 --> 00:10:36,450
But don't you think it's better if we just stay friends?
但你不覺得 我們還是當朋友比較好嗎？

138
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,730
Seriously, what?
你是說…什麼？

139
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:44,540
Okay. You know what?
好吧，這樣好了

140
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:49,470
If you want to, we can do it one more time.
如果你要的話 我們可以再做一次

141
00:10:51,410 --> 00:10:55,780
I mean, I'd be okay with that. In fact, I have some time right now..
我沒有問題 事實上我現在有空…

142
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:57,040
Okay.
好了

143
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:59,190
You know what? Can I talk now?
你知道嗎？我可以說話了嗎？

144
00:10:59,350 --> 00:11:01,250
-Oh, sure. -Okay.
-當然可以 -好吧

145
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:09,420
I'm pregnant.
我懷孕了

146
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,330
Ross?
羅斯

147
00:11:20,210 --> 00:11:21,640
Ross?
羅斯

148
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:25,510
Okay, whenever you're ready.
好吧，我等你準備好再說

149
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:35,490
And you're the father, by the way. But you got..
對了，你是孩子的爸 但你有…

150
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:44,120
-Can I get you some water? -I'm good.
-你要喝水嗎？ -我沒事

151
00:11:44,770 --> 00:11:50,800
Ross, there is no pressure on you, okay? I mean, you can be as involved as you want.
羅斯，別覺得有什麼壓力，好嗎？ 你想怎麼做都可以的

152
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:56,670
Yeah, I..
對，我…

153
00:11:56,840 --> 00:12:00,280
I'm just, I don't know. I don't understand..
我只是不知道… 我不瞭解…

154
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:04,410
how this happened.
怎麼會發生這種事

155
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:10,380
-We used a condom. -I know.
-我們有用保險套 -我知道

156
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:15,690
But you know, condoms only work, like,97 percent of the time.
但保險套的避孕功能 只有百分之九十七

157
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:17,720
What?
什麼？

158
00:12:19,930 --> 00:12:21,530
What?!
什麼？

159
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:26,470
Well, they should put that on the box!
他們應該標示在包裝上

160
00:12:28,910 --> 00:12:31,500
-They do. -No, they don't!
-包裝上有標示 -才沒有

161
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:41,880
Well, they should put it in huge block letters!
他們應該用又大又粗的字體 標示在包裝上

162
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:47,430
-Ross, let's just forget about the condoms. -Well, I may as well have!
-羅斯，別管保險套的事 -早知道當時也不用管了

163
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:52,030
Listen, you know what? I was really freaked out too..
聽著，你知道嗎？ 我發現自己懷孕時…

164
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:55,000
-when I found out. -Freaked..? Hey, I'm not freaked out.
-也嚇壞了 -嚇壞了？我才沒有

165
00:12:56,170 --> 00:12:59,440
I'm indignant as a consumer!
我是個憤怒的消費者

166
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:05,180
-You know what? Let's talk later. -No, I wanna talk now.
-你知道嗎？我們待會再談 -不，我想現在談

167
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:07,510
In fact, I wanna talk..
事實上我想…

168
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:11,850
to the president of the condom company.
跟保險套公司的 董事長談

169
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:14,450
Okay, you know what? Maybe I should come back.. Okay.
你知道嗎？ 或許我該待會再來…好吧

170
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:18,020
Yeah, I'll press one!
好吧，我按一

171
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:27,590
-I looked everywhere. There's no gas leak. -So then I can heat this up?
-我到處找過，瓦斯沒有漏氣 -我可以熱一下這個嗎？

172
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:30,570
Anyway, I'll get moving on that new door.
總之我會幫他們 裝扇新門

173
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:35,700
Great. Listen, could you do us a favor and not tell Chandler and Monica about this?
太棒了，你能幫我們一個忙 別跟錢德和摩妮卡提這件事嗎？

174
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:39,570
Because, you know, they don't have any kids of their own..
因為他們沒有 自己的孩子…

175
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:43,050
and this door was like a child to them.
這扇門就像是他們的孩子

176
00:13:44,250 --> 00:13:47,550
Well, I'm gonna have to put on a new lock. They'll find out anyway.
我得裝上新鎖 他們一定會發現的

177
00:13:49,020 --> 00:13:53,980
It's looking like an all-day job. I'm gonna have to cancel my yoga class.
看樣子要干一整天 我得去取消我的瑜伽課

178
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:57,690
Hey, Ross. Could you tell Jasmine I can't make it to yoga class today?
羅斯，麻煩你告訴茉莉 今天我沒辦法去上瑜伽課

179
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:59,130
Sure.
沒問題

180
00:14:04,540 --> 00:14:08,530
-Oh, my God! What happened to the door? -So it's noticeable, huh?
-天啊，門是怎麼了？ -很明顯喔？

181
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:12,670
-Look, is Rachel here? I need to talk to her. -Didn't you two already talk?
-瑞秋在這裡嗎？我得跟她談一談 -你們不是談過了嗎？

182
00:14:12,850 --> 00:14:14,410
Yeah, but..
對，但是…

183
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:18,850
Okay. Look, you guys know that Rachel and I slept together..
聽著，你們知道 瑞秋跟我上過床…

184
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:21,080
but there's something else.
但除此之外還有別的

185
00:14:23,090 --> 00:14:24,490
Rachel's pregnant.
瑞秋懷孕了

186
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:27,490
-Holy mother of God! -Oh, my God, I can't believe that!
-我的老天爺 -天啊，我不敢相信

187
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:35,230
-With my child. -That is brand-new information!
-她懷了我的孩子 -我是第一次聽到這件事

188
00:14:39,610 --> 00:14:42,700
-You already know, don't you? -Little bit.
-你們已經知道了對不對？ -知道一點

189
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:47,280
-How you doing? -Okay. I mean, I'll be okay.
-你還好嗎？ -我會沒事的

190
00:14:47,450 --> 00:14:49,940
It's just, I don't think I handled it very well.
我想 我沒有處理好

191
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:52,450
-What'd you say to her? -Nothing.
-你跟她說了什麼？ -什麼都沒說

192
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:56,750
But the complaint department at the condom company got an earful.
但我跟保險公司的客服部門 說了很多

193
00:14:57,420 --> 00:15:00,290
-Then when I turned around, she was gone. -Oh, Ross.
-我一轉身才發現她走了 -羅斯

194
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:06,300
I know. But in my defense, I just found out that condoms are only, like,97% effective.
我知道，但我剛剛才發現 保險套只有百分之九十七的避孕效果

195
00:15:06,470 --> 00:15:09,230
-What? -I gotta go find her.
-什麼？ -我得去找她

196
00:15:09,400 --> 00:15:12,340
Hey. Hold on! Are you serious?
等一下，你是認真的？

197
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:15,630
So, like,3 percent of the time, they don't even work?
所以有百分之三的機率 它們無法發揮功能？

198
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:19,840
They should put that on the box!
他們應該在包裝上做標示

199
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:23,710
-Evidently, they do. -What?!
-他們的確那麼做了 -什麼？

200
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,350
Well, I'll be.
真的咧

201
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:42,690
-I can't believe we're here. -You've gotta be kidding.
-我不敢相信我們來到這裡了 -開什麼玩笑

202
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:44,430
What?
什麼？

203
00:15:46,310 --> 00:15:50,270
As a wedding gift to you, the hotel would like to give you the honeymoon suite.
為了慶祝你們結婚 飯店要幫你們升等到蜜月套房

204
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:53,610
No! You have been screwing us all day!
不，你們破壞了我們一整天

205
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:58,240
-Who are you? -We're you. Just 10 seconds later!
-你們是誰？ -我們是你們，只是遲了十秒鐘

206
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:03,810
You already got the first-class tickets, the lounge. We should get free stuff too!
你們已經搶走頭等艙的位置、休息室 我們也應該得到免費招待

207
00:16:03,990 --> 00:16:06,550
You're not the only ones on your honeymoon!
不光是你們 在度蜜月

208
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:12,570
You can have the suite if you want. We don't care about where we stay.
我們可以把蜜月套房讓給你們 我們不在乎要睡在哪裡

209
00:16:12,730 --> 00:16:15,130
We're here to celebrate our love for each other.
我們來這裡 紀念我們對彼此的愛

210
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:19,140
We don't have to get free stuff. We just want to be together.
我們不需要免費招待 我們只想在一起

211
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:24,300
We need the stuff.
我們需要免費招待

212
00:16:27,050 --> 00:16:31,040
Monica, it's Joey. Phoebe and I smell gas coming from your apartment.
摩妮卡，我是喬伊 菲比跟我聞到你家有瓦斯味

213
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:35,920
-What? Are you serious? Joey smells gas. -What else is new?
-什麼？真的嗎？喬伊聞到瓦斯味 -還有什麼新消息？

214
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:41,320
-We'd check it out, but you took our keys. -Well, do something. Get in there!
-我們想看一下，但你拿走我們的鑰匙 -快想辦法進去

215
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:45,960
-How? I guess I could break down your door. -Yeah, do that.
-要怎麼辦呢？我可以把你家大門撞開 -對，就那麼做

216
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:49,360
-And you won't blame us for any damage? -No.
-你不會怪我們弄壞東西？ -不會

217
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:56,040
-Are you doing it? I don't hear anything. -Okay, I'll break it down.
-你在撞門了嗎？我沒有聽到聲音 -好吧，我來撞門了

218
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:03,410
Hi. He's doing it, he's breaking down the door.
嗨，他正在撞門 他要把門撞開了

219
00:17:07,350 --> 00:17:09,320
Okay, we're in.
好了，我們進來了

220
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:18,120
-Okay, Rachel, are you comfortable? -If I said I was, would you judge me?
-瑞秋，你還舒服嗎？ -如果我很舒服，你會審判我嗎？

221
00:17:18,430 --> 00:17:20,900
The doctor'll be here in a minute to do your sonogram.
醫生馬上過來 幫你照超音波

222
00:17:21,070 --> 00:17:22,160
Okay.
好的

223
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:30,180
Oh, man, I swear, if they sold these at Pottery Barn..
天啊，我發誓 如果他們在陶瓷店賣這個…

224
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:34,170
-Hi. -Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

225
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:35,870
We need to talk.
我們得談一談

226
00:17:36,050 --> 00:17:40,920
Right now? Because I kind of got an alfresco situation going on over here.
現在嗎？ 我現在的姿勢有點不雅

227
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:45,520
Please, I really.. I want to apologize for the way I acted earlier today.
拜託，我真的…我想 為我剛剛的表現向你道歉

228
00:17:45,690 --> 00:17:49,530
-That's fine. Can you stay up near my head? -What? Oh, yeah, sorry.
-沒關係，麻煩你待在床頭邊 -什麼？抱歉

229
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:55,400
I went crazy. I was thinking about myself when I should've been thinking about you..
我瘋了，我只想到自己 我應該要想到你的…

230
00:17:55,570 --> 00:17:57,830
-Okay, head, Ross! Head, Ross! -Right.
-沒關係，待在床頭這邊，羅斯 -對

231
00:17:58,010 --> 00:18:02,570
I want you to know that I'm gonna be there through this whole thing. Okay?
我要你知道 我會一直陪在你身邊，好嗎？

232
00:18:02,740 --> 00:18:07,910
The doctor's appointments, the Lamaze classes, baby-proofing the apartment.
來做產檢、上拉梅茲呼吸課 為寶寶裝潢公寓

233
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:10,710
Although, we can worry about that after we get married.
但我們可以等到婚後 再擔心那些事

234
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,510
-Married? -Well, yeah, I think we should get married.
-婚後？ -對，我想我們應該結婚

235
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:16,660
Because that's your answer to everything?
那就是你的解決方法嗎？

236
00:18:18,790 --> 00:18:21,660
No. Because that's the right thing to do.
不，那麼做是對的

237
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:27,430
Yeah, maybe, if you're in love. But Ross, we are not in love, are we?
或許吧，只要我們相愛 羅斯，我們並不相愛，對吧？

238
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:33,230
No. But still, I mean, you can't possibly do this alone.
對，但是 你不可能一個人這麼做

239
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,970
Excuse me?
你說什麼？

240
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:40,670
-You can't even eat alone in a restaurant. -What?
-你甚至沒辦法一個人到餐廳吃飯 -什麼？

241
00:18:40,850 --> 00:18:44,750
If you can't eat by yourself, how do you expect to have a baby by yourself?
如果你沒辦法一個人吃飯 你怎麼一個人帶孩子？

242
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:48,510
-I can too eat by myself! -When have you ever?
-我可以一個人吃飯 -你什麼時候那麼做過？

243
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:53,350
When certain people leave the table and I am not finished!
當某些同桌的人吃完飯 我還沒有吃完的時候

244
00:18:53,530 --> 00:18:57,020
Well, certain other people take two hours to eat a bowl of soup!
有些人光喝一碗湯 就得花掉兩個小時

245
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:59,460
Oh, please. You inhale your food.
拜託，你是狼吞虎嚥

246
00:18:59,630 --> 00:19:03,660
I grew up with Monica. If you didn't eat fast, you didn't eat!
我跟摩妮卡一起長大 不吃快一點的話就沒得吃了

247
00:19:07,070 --> 00:19:08,370
Am I interrupting?
我打擾你們了嗎？

248
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:12,210
No, Dr. Long. Please come in. This is Ross. He is the father.
不，朗格醫生，請進 他是羅斯，孩子的爸爸

249
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:15,910
But not the husband, because, evidently, she can do this alone.
但我不是她的丈夫 因為顯然她能單獨帶大孩子

250
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:20,250
Nice to meet you. I'll get started on this.
很高興能見到你，我要開始檢查了

251
00:19:22,490 --> 00:19:27,430
-Why you can't admit you need me? -I need you to stay near my head!
-你為什麼不能承認你需要我？ -我需要你站在床頭這邊

252
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:34,430
Okay. Everything looks good. Here it is on the screen.
好吧，看起來很正常 銀幕上的劃面是這樣的

253
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:37,460
Here's your uterus..
這是你的子宮…

254
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:41,730
and right here is your baby.
寶寶在這裡

255
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,210
Oh, my God.
天啊

256
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:51,750
There it is. I see it.
它在那裡，我看到了

257
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:55,360
Congratulations. I'll give you two a minute.
恭喜 我讓你們獨處一下

258
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,790
-Okay. -Thank you.
-好吧 -謝謝

259
00:20:05,230 --> 00:20:07,430
Pretty amazing, huh?
很神奇吧？

260
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:10,100
I don't see it!
我看不到它

261
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:22,170
-What? -I can't see it.
-什麼？ -我看不到它

262
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:24,670
But you just said that you did.
但你說你看到了

263
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:28,410
I know. I lied. I didn't want her to think I was a terrible mother.
我知道，我說謊 我不希望她認為我是個很糟糕的母親

264
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:30,390
I can't even see my own baby!
我連自己的寶寶都看不到

265
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:36,590
Oh, sure. Come here. Sure, you can. Come here. Look, it's right there.
當然，過來，你可以看到的 過來，就在這裡

266
00:20:42,140 --> 00:20:44,500
Oh, it's beautiful.
好漂亮

267
00:20:45,310 --> 00:20:47,360
I see it now.
我看到了

268
00:20:48,910 --> 00:20:51,940
-Do you really? -No, I don't see it!
-真的嗎？ -不，我看不到

269
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:55,210
Okay. Come on. All right. Okay.
好吧，來吧

270
00:20:55,380 --> 00:21:00,840
You see this tiny thing that looks like a peanut?
你看到那個像花生一樣的 小東西了嗎？

271
00:21:01,390 --> 00:21:02,620
Yeah.
是的

272
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:05,320
Sweetie, that's it.
甜心，就是那個

273
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:07,520
That's it?
就是那個？

274
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:10,260
Well, I saw that.
我看到了

275
00:21:16,300 --> 00:21:18,740
-Thank you. -You're welcome.
-謝謝 -別客氣

276
00:21:22,110 --> 00:21:26,670
Wow, I can't believe that's our baby.
我不敢相信那是我們的孩子

277
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:32,450
Yeah, that's our baby.
對，那是我們的孩子

278
00:21:39,930 --> 00:21:41,550
Well, they put up the new door.
他們裝了新門

279
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:44,790
-So it's all locked up and secure? -Yeah. Why?
-門都鎖好了嗎？ -對，怎麼了？

280
00:21:45,170 --> 00:21:49,430
I was trying to figure out how bad I want one of Monica's turkey pot pies.
我想知道我有多想吃 摩妮卡的火雞肉派

281
00:21:50,670 --> 00:21:52,760
-Hi. -Hey.
-嗨 -嘿

282
00:21:52,940 --> 00:21:56,170
-So how was the doctor? -Everything went great.
-醫生怎麼說？ -一切都很順利

283
00:21:56,340 --> 00:21:59,870
-Good. -Hey, show them the picture of your uterus.
-很好 -讓他們看看你子宮的照片

284
00:22:05,890 --> 00:22:07,680
I don't see the baby. Where is it?
我看不到寶寶，它在哪裡？

285
00:22:07,850 --> 00:22:11,690
Oh, no, I know. I couldn't see it either at first. But it's right..
不，我知道，剛開始我也看不到 但它就在…

286
00:22:13,230 --> 00:22:15,460
Ross, I lost it again.
羅斯，我又看不到了

287
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


288
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
